    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara yanjina Aiziraeli auyira tsona kuhenda uyi mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, naye achiatiya mikononi mwa Afilisti kpwa miaka mirongo mine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho kpwakala na mutu mmwenga ko Zora yeihwa Manoa kula mbari ya Dani. Naye mchewe kala ni tasa, kayavyala mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wamtsembukira achimuamba yuya mchetu, “Dzagbwe u tasa, kuvyala, ela vivi undagbwira mimba nawe undavyala mwana wa chilume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo dzimanyirire, usinwe uchi wala kurya chochosi ambacho ni najisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.6.1+NUM.6.2+NUM.6.3+NUM.6.4+NUM.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 6:1–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana undaphaha mimba na undavyala mwana mlume. Usimnyole ye mwana, mana andakala akatengbwa kpwa ajili ya Mlungu hangu ndanini mwa nine, naye andaandza kuativya Aiziraeli kula mikononi mwa Afilisti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho yuya mchetu wakpwendaambira mlumewe, “Mutu wa Mlungu akanedzera, na nchivyomuona akaigana na malaika wa Mlungu wa kuogofya sana nami nkainjirwa ni chiwewe, hata simuuzire alako wala kakaniambira dzinare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela akaniamba, ‘Undagbwira mimba na undavyala mwana wa chilume. Kpwa hivyo usinwe uchi wala kurya chochosi chiricho najisi, mana ye mwana andakala akatengbwa kpwa ajili ya kazi ya Mlungu hangu ndanini mwa nine hadi siku ndiyofwa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoa wamvoya Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba, “Ee! Mwenyezi Mlungu navoya umuhume tsona ye mutu wa Mlungu edze ahufundze kuhusu ye mwana wa chilume ndiyevyalwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu wasikira mavoyo ga Manoa, naye malaika wa Mlungu achimtsembukira ye mchetu wakati kala asegere mundani ela mlumewe, Manoa, kala kaphamwenga naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ye mchetu wawania kpwendamuambira mlumewe achimuamba, “Ye mutu yenitsembukira siku hira, akanitsembukira tsona rero!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoa waphiya phamwenga na mchewe, na ariphomuona yuya mutu wamuuza, “We ndiwe uriyegomba na mkpwazangu?” Naye achijibu achiamba, “Ni mimi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho Manoa achimuuza, “Siku maneno urigogomba gachitimiya ye mwana ni arerwedze na kaziye indakala iphi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba Manoa, “Iye mchetu naalunge gosi nrigomuambira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye ni asirye chochosi chitengezwacho kula kpwa zabibu, wala asinwe uchi wa zabibu au uchi wowosi hura ama kurya chochosi chiricho najisi. Iye naalunge chila chitu nrichomlagiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoa achimuamba Malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu, “Nakuvoya uhugodze chidide hukutayarishire mwana mbuzi urye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba Manoa, “Hata nchikugodzerani, chisha sindarya chakurya chenu, ela ichikala mundatayarisha sadaka ya kuochwa, ilavyeni kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu.” (Mana Manoa kayamanya kukala ni malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Manoa wamuuza yuya malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba, “Dzinaro ndiwe ani? Ili higa uchigogomba gachihendeka huweze kukulika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba Manoa, “Kpwa utu wani unauza dzina rangu? Uwe kundarielewa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Manoa wahala mwana mbuzi achimtayarisha, na achihala sadaka ya unga achimlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu pho dzulu ya dziwe. Ela malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wahenda dzambo ra kuangalaza kuno Manoa na mchewe analola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati myale ya moho phounuka kuelekeya dzulu kula pho phokala yo sadaka, ye malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wapaa na yo myale ya moho ya pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka. Manoa na mchewe adzibwaga chimabumabu, ariphoona higo gakahendeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoa achimanya kukala iye kala ni malaika wa Mwenyezi Mlungu. Naye kayauya tsona kpwa Manoa na mchewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphoona hivyo Manoa wamuamba mchewe, “Kpwa kpweli hundafwa, mana hukamuona Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mchewe achimuamba, “Kalapho Mwenyezi Mlungu che ahuolage, asingekubali sadaka yehu ya kuochwa na ya unga au kuhuonyesa mambo higa gosi au kuhuambira mambo dza higa wakati uhu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye mkpwaza Manoa wavyala mwana mlume, naye achimuiha Samsoni. Kadiri ya ye mwana arivyokula, Mwenyezi Mlungu wamjaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi roho wa Mwenyezi Mlungu waandza kuhenda kazi ndani ya Samsoni, wakati Samsoni ariphokala anasagala kpwenye kambi ya mbari ya Dani, yokala kahi-kahi ya midzi ya Zora na Eshitaoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
